      "text": "Shoma Lyzerius carries 2 Acid Flask (Moderate), 2 Bottled Lightning (Moderate), 2 Elixir of Life (Lesser), 6 moderate lyzerium vials, and 2 Tanglefoot Bag (Lesser). These items last for 24 hours, or until the next time he makes his daily preparations. He can spend an action to create an additional dose of any one of these items, or any of the items listed as formulas in his book."
